{
  "schema": 1,
  "name": "Ranger waterskins share the potion-sickness pool with potions (#6911)",
  "contract": "Crude Waterskin 10521 (spell 800269) and Minor Healing Potion 118 (spell 439) both declare item category 5004 with a 60s cooldown, and the client enforces that pool across spell families. Using a potion must put the waterskin spell on ~60s server cooldown and block waterskin use; using a waterskin must put potion spells on ~60s and block potion use. Potion 441 cross-lock is the working reference. Each direction runs on a fresh actor so no waits are needed.",
  "timeout_ms": 90000,
  "players": [
